#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:16
msgid "Breaking Enhancements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:19
msgid "Cookie SameSite Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:21
msgid ""
"CodeIgniter 4.0.5 introduces a setting for the cookie SameSite attribute."
" Prior versions did not set this attribute at all. The default setting "
"for cookies is now `Lax`. This will affect how cookies are handled in "
"cross-domain contexts and you may need to adjust this setting in your "
"projects. Separate settings in **app/Config/App.php** exists for Response"
" cookies and for CSRF cookies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:26
msgid ""
"For additional information, see `MDN Web Docs "
"<https://developer.mozilla.org/pl/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Set-"
"Cookie/SameSite>`_. The SameSite specifications are described in `RFC "
"6265 <https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc6265>`_ and the `RFC 6265bis "
"revision <https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-httpbis-"
"rfc6265bis/?include_text=1>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:31
msgid "Message::getHeader(s)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:33
msgid ""
"The HTTP layer is moving towards `PSR-7 compliance <https://www.php-"
"fig.org/psr/psr-7/>`_. Towards this end ``Message::getHeader()`` and "
"``Message::getHeaders()`` are deprecated and should be replaced with "
"``Message::header()`` and ``Message::headers()`` respectively. Note that "
"this pertains to all classes that extend ``Message`` as well: "
"``Request``, ``Response`` and their subclasses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:38
msgid "Additional related deprecations from the HTTP layer:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:40
msgid "``Message::isJSON()``: Check the \"Content-Type\" header directly"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:41
msgid ""
"``Request[Interface]::isValidIP()``: Use the Validation class with "
"``valid_ip``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:42
msgid ""
"``Request[Interface]::getMethod()``: The ``$upper`` parameter will be "
"removed, use strtoupper()"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:43
msgid "``Request[Trait]::$ipAddress``: This property will become private"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:44
msgid ""
"``Request::$proxyIPs``: This property will be removed; access "
"``config('App')->proxyIPs`` directly"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:45
msgid ""
"``Request::__construct()``: The constructor will no longer take "
"``Config\\App`` and has been made nullable to aid transition"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:46
msgid "``Response[Interface]::getReason()``: Use ``getReasonPhrase()`` instead"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:47
msgid ""
"``Response[Interface]::getStatusCode()``: The explicit ``int`` return "
"type will be removed (no action required)"
msgstr ""

