#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:78
msgid "Config\\\\Services"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:80
msgid ""
"Service discovery has been updated to allow third-party services (when "
"enabled via Modules) to take precedence over core services. Update "
"**app/Config/Services.php** so the class extends "
"``CodeIgniter\\Config\\BaseService`` to allow proper discovery of third-"
"party services."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:84
msgid "Project Files"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:86
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Numerous files in the project space (root, app, public, writable) "
"received updates. Due to these files being outside of the system scope "
"they will not be changed without your intervention. There are some third-"
"party CodeIgniter modules available to assist with merging changes to the"
" project space: `Explore on Packagist "
"<https://packagist.org/explore/?query=codeigniter4%20updates>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_405.rst:91
msgid ""
"Except in very rare cases for bug fixes, no changes made to files for the"
" project space will break your application. All changes noted here are "
"optional until the next major version, and any mandatory changes will be "
"covered in the sections above."
msgstr ""

